{"architectures":["x64"],"id":"Kopia.KopiaCLI","latestVersion":"0.23.1","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"Cross-platform backup tool for Windows, macOS & Linux with fast, incremental backups, client-side end-to-end encryption, compression and data deduplication. CLI and GUI included.","license":"Apache-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/kopia/kopia/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"Cross-platform backup tool for Windows, macOS & Linux with fast, incremental backups, client-side end-to-end encryption, compression and data deduplication. CLI and GUI included.","license":"Apache-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/kopia/kopia/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"Kopia is a fast and secure open-source backup/restore tool that allows you to create encrypted snapshots of your data and save the snapshots to remote or cloud storage of your choice, to network-attached storage or server, or locally on your machine.\nKopia does not 'image' your whole machine.\nRather, Kopia allows you to backup/restore any and all files/directories that you deem are important or critical.","moniker":"kopiacli","name":"KopiaCLI","packageUrl":"https://kopia.io/","publisher":"Kopia Authors","publisherUrl":"https://kopia.io/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/kopia/kopia/releases/tag/v0.23.1","tags":["backup","cloud","deduplication","encryption","foss"]}},"longDescription":"Kopia is a fast and secure open-source backup/restore tool that allows you to create encrypted snapshots of your data and save the snapshots to remote or cloud storage of your choice, to network-attached storage or server, or locally on your machine.\nKopia does not 'image' your whole machine.\nRather, Kopia allows you to backup/restore any and all files/directories that you deem are important or critical.","moniker":"kopiacli","name":"KopiaCLI","packageUrl":"https://kopia.io/","publisher":"Kopia Authors","publisherUrl":"https://